# Exclude vendored skill trees from the semantic index.
#
# Vendored skill prose is not this repo's code: indexing it inflates embedding
# time and lets skill content outrank notifier's own source in codebase_search
# results. Layered on top of SocratiCode's built-in defaults + .gitignore.
#
# skills/ is deliberately NOT excluded — it holds this repo's first-party skill
# overrides (brainstorming, shipping-work-python-fastapi). Its other entries are
# symlinks into skills-vendor/, which is excluded below.
skills-vendor/
.claude/skills/
